//Long hair
# Long hair: three layered sheets around the back and sides. Each layer is an ellipse whose half-axes
# crx(s), cry(s) (s from the crown, z = 12.3 - 8.2 s) hug the inside of the hair cap at the top, then keep
# clear of the capelet, arms, book, bows and skirt, and flare out below the waist. The sheet is sculpted
# into clumps: cg is 0 in a groove and 1 on a clump's ridge. Ridges stand out, each clump sways and waves
# more toward its end, and ends in a pointed tip that curls outward.
crx(s)=0.84911+6.04016*s+(-151.99699)*max(0,s-0.04)^2+184.35121*max(0,s-0.06545)^2+(-30.5978)*max(0,s-0.09091)^2+(-2.08753)*max(0,s-0.11636)^2+(-2.10269)*max(0,s-0.14182)^2+9.53329*max(0,s-0.16727)^2+(-24.19092)*max(0,s-0.19273)^2+56.54616*max(0,s-0.21818)^2+68.45592*max(0,s-0.24364)^2+(-126.54525)*max(0,s-0.26909)^2+(-82.00933)*max(0,s-0.29455)^2+136.29335*max(0,s-0.32)^2+(-72.56243)*max(0,s-0.38)^2+36.59309*max(0,s-0.45)^2+7.27215*max(0,s-0.52)^2+(-10.24216)*max(0,s-0.59)^2+5.80294*max(0,s-0.66)^2+(-7.321)*max(0,s-0.73)^2+1.06221*max(0,s-0.8)^2+20.02708*max(0,s-0.87)^2+17.05965*max(0,s-0.94)^2
cry(s)=0.94305+4.68262*s+(-109.4489)*max(0,s-0.04)^2+121.56724*max(0,s-0.06545)^2+(-3.90892)*max(0,s-0.09091)^2+(-12.32409)*max(0,s-0.11636)^2+5.91378*max(0,s-0.14182)^2+(-2.58048)*max(0,s-0.16727)^2+1.13109*max(0,s-0.19273)^2+(-0.53096)*max(0,s-0.21818)^2+0.33025*max(0,s-0.24364)^2+(-0.37205)*max(0,s-0.26909)^2+0.55046*max(0,s-0.29455)^2+(-0.50707)*max(0,s-0.32)^2+0.43096*max(0,s-0.38)^2+(-0.78122)*max(0,s-0.45)^2+1.74523*max(0,s-0.52)^2+(-4.19479)*max(0,s-0.59)^2+14.7196*max(0,s-0.66)^2+(-0.66916)*max(0,s-0.73)^2+(-10.82846)*max(0,s-0.8)^2+1.9605*max(0,s-0.87)^2+(-1.37688)*max(0,s-0.94)^2
cg(k,nc,ph)=abs(sin(pi*((k+1)/2*nc+ph)))
